msgstr "Wygeneruj XML zasobów Androida dla nazwanego motywu (używając dołączonego `@pantoken/tokens` IR)."

#: platforms/android/src/functions/generateAndroid.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The paths of the written `colors.xml` and `dimens.xml`."
msgstr "Ścieżki do zapisanych `colors.xml` i `dimens.xml`."

#: platforms/android/src/functions/toAndroid.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: toAndroid()"
msgstr "# Funkcja: toAndroid()"

#: platforms/android/src/functions/toAndroid.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Emit Android resource XML for an explicit token IR."
msgstr "Wygeneruj plik XML zasobów Androida dla jawnego IR tokena."

#: platforms/android/src/functions/toAndroid.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Emit a specific theme's IR**"
msgstr "**Wygeneruj IR dla konkretnego motywu**"

#: platforms/android/src/functions/toAndroid.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Dark mode with icon VectorDrawables**"
msgstr "**Tryb ciemny z ikonami VectorDrawables**"

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# android"
msgstr "# android"

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/android` — emit Instructure design tokens as Android resource XML."
msgstr "`@pantoken/android` — emituje tokeny projektowe Instructure jako XML zasobów Androida."

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It flattens the IR to concrete, single-mode values (`@pantoken/core`'s `toStyleDictionary`), then\nemits `res/values/colors.xml` (colour tokens) and `res/values/dimens.xml` (dimension tokens) via\n`@pantoken/sd-config`. Style Dictionary applies the Android transforms (`#aarrggbb`, `dp`/`sp`)."
msgstr "Spłaszcza IR do konkretnych, jednorodnych wartości (`@pantoken/core`'s `toStyleDictionary`), then\nemituje `res/values/colors.xml` (tokeny kolorów) i `res/values/dimens.xml` (tokeny wymiarów) za pomocą\n`@pantoken/sd-config`. Style Dictionary stosuje transformacje Androida (`#aarrggbb`, `dp`/`sp`)."

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [generateAndroid](functions/generateAndroid.md)"
msgstr "Zmienia nazwę i ponownie eksportuje [generateAndroid](functions/generateAndroid.md)"

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: GenerateAndroidOptions"
msgstr "# Interfejs: GenerateAndroidOptions"

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [generateAndroid](../functions/generateAndroid.md) / [toAndroid](../functions/toAndroid.md)."
msgstr "Opcje dla [generateAndroid](../functions/generateAndroid.md) / [toAndroid](../functions/toAndroid.md)."

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### outDir"
msgstr "### outDir"

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The output directory; files are written under `<outDir>/res/values`."
msgstr "The output directory; files are written under `&lt;outDir&gt;/res/values`."

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The theme to emit (default: `\"rebrand\"`)."
msgstr "Motyw do wygenerowania (domyślnie: `\"rebrand\"`)."

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Which `light-dark()` mode to resolve (default: `\"light\"`)."
msgstr "Który tryb `light-dark()` ma zostać rozwiązany (domyślnie: `\"light\"`)."

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Icon names to also emit as VectorDrawables under `res/drawable` (default: none)."
msgstr "Nazwy ikon do dodatkowego wygenerowania jako VectorDrawable w `res/drawable` (domyślnie: brak)."

