#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/functions/defaultThemeCssAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: defaultThemeCssAssets()"
msgstr "# Funkcja: defaultThemeCssAssets()"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/functions/defaultThemeCssAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The component-style sheets for a given theme/mode pair (token sheet plus the constant set)."
msgstr "Arkusze stylów komponentów dla danej pary motyw/tryb (arkusz tokenów oraz zestaw stałych)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# canvas-theme-editor"
msgstr "# canvas-theme-editor"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/canvas-theme-editor` — upload-ready `theme.css`/`theme.js` for Canvas LMS's Theme\nEditor, pre-wired to pantoken's CDN-hosted CSS. Consumed by `@pantoken/scaffold`'s\n`canvas-theme-editor` platform; also usable standalone."
msgstr "`@pantoken/canvas-theme-editor` — gotowy do przesłania `theme.css`/`theme.js` dla Theme\nEditora Canvas LMS, wstępnie podłączony do CSS hostowanego w CDN pantoken. Wykorzystywany przez platformę\n`canvas-theme-editor` firmy `@pantoken/scaffold`; można go także używać samodzielnie."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`THEME_CSS`/`THEME_JS` are the jsDelivr-default, unpinned output — use [buildTheme](functions/buildTheme.md) to\ntarget a different CDN provider, pin a version, or swap in other pantoken/third-party assets."
msgstr "`THEME_CSS`/`THEME_JS` to domyślny, nieprzypięty (unpinned) wynik jsDelivr — użyj [buildTheme](functions/buildTheme.md), aby\nukierunkować na innego dostawcę CDN, przypiąć wersję lub podmienić na inne zasoby pantoken/firm trzecich."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: BuildThemeOptions"
msgstr "# Interfejs: BuildThemeOptions"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [buildTheme](../functions/buildTheme.md)/[buildThemeCss](../functions/buildThemeCss.md)/[buildThemeJs](../functions/buildThemeJs.md)."
msgstr "Opcje dla [buildTheme](../functions/buildTheme.md)/[buildThemeCss](../functions/buildThemeCss.md)/[buildThemeJs](../functions/buildThemeJs.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### provider?"
msgstr "### provider?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CDN provider to build URLs for. Defaults to jsDelivr when omitted."
msgstr "Dostawca CDN, dla którego mają być tworzone adresy URL. Domyślnie jsDelivr, jeśli pominięto."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### version?"
msgstr "### version?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pins the version for every asset below that doesn't specify its own `version`."
msgstr "Przypina wersję dla każdego zasobu poniżej, który nie określa własnego `version`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Token theme variant. Defaults to `\"rebrand\"`. Ignored when `css` is supplied."
msgstr "Wariant motywu tokenów. Domyślnie `\"rebrand\"`. Ignorowany, gdy podano `css`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Rebrand token mode. Defaults to `\"light\"`. Ignored outside the `rebrand` theme, or when `css` is supplied."
msgstr "Tryb tokenów rebrandingu. Domyślnie `\"light\"`. Ignorowany poza motywem `rebrand` lub gdy podano `css`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### css?"
msgstr "### css?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Component-style sheets. Defaults to [defaultThemeCssAssets](../functions/defaultThemeCssAssets.md) for `theme`/`mode`."
msgstr "Arkusze stylów komponentów. Domyślnie [defaultThemeCssAssets](../functions/defaultThemeCssAssets.md) dla `theme`/`mode`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### fonts?"
msgstr "### fonts?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Font sheet(s). Defaults to [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_FONT\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_FONT_ASSETS.md)."
msgstr "Arkusz(e) fontów. Domyślnie [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_FONT\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_FONT_ASSETS.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### js?"
msgstr "### js?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Script(s). Defaults to [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_JS\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_JS_ASSETS.md)."
msgstr "Skrypt(y). Domyślnie [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_JS\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_JS_ASSETS.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### strings?"
msgstr "### strings?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Translated comment strings. Defaults to [ENGLISH\\_THEME\\_STRINGS](../variables/ENGLISH_THEME_STRINGS.md)."
msgstr "Przetłumaczone ciągi komentarzy. Domyślnie [ENGLISH\\_THEME\\_STRINGS](../variables/ENGLISH_THEME_STRINGS.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: CdnFile"
msgstr "# Interfejs: CdnFile"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A single file to load from a CDN, identified by npm package name and path within it."
msgstr "Pojedynczy plik do załadowania z CDN, zidentyfikowany nazwą pakietu npm i ścieżką w jego strukturze."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### package"
msgstr "### package"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The npm package name, e.g. `\"@pantoken/components\"`."
msgstr "Nazwa pakietu npm, np. `\"@pantoken/components\"`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The path within the package, e.g. `\"dist/components.css\"`. Omit to reference the package root."
msgstr "Ścieżka wewnątrz pakietu, np. `\"dist/components.css\"`. Pomiń, aby odwołać się do katalogu głównego pakietu."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Overrides the provider/build-level version for this file only."
msgstr "Nadpisuje wersję dostawcy/poziomu build tylko dla tego pliku."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### raw?"
msgstr "### raw?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For providers that transform JS by default (esm.sh): `false` lets the provider apply its normal\nESM transform (needed to `import` a real package entry point). Defaults to `true` — serve the\nfile verbatim, required for prebuilt/non-ESM assets like CSS sheets and IIFE bundles."
msgstr "Dla dostawców, którzy domyślnie transformują JS (esm.sh): `false` pozwala dostawcy zastosować jego normalną\ntransformację ESM (potrzebną do `import` rzeczywistego punktu wejścia pakietu). Domyślnie `true` — serwuj\nplik dosłownie, wymagane dla wstępnie zbudowanych/nie-ESM zasobów, takich jak arkusze CSS i paczki IIFE."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: CdnProvider"
msgstr "# Interfejs: CdnProvider"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A CDN that can serve npm package files. Providers never hardcode a package name — they only\nknow how to shape a URL from a [CdnFile](CdnFile.md)."
msgstr "CDN, który może serwować pliki pakietów npm. Dostawcy nigdy nie umieszczają nazwy pakietu na stałe — oni tylko\nwiedzą, jak ukształtować URL z [CdnFile](CdnFile.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### id"
msgstr "### id"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stable identifier, e.g. `\"jsdelivr\"`."
msgstr "Stabilny identyfikator, np. `\"jsdelivr\"`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
